window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>The gripping conclusion to the Saint View Slayers vs. Sinners series. Kara, Hawk, Hayden, and Grayson's series concludes here.</b></p> <p><b>Please note this blurb has spoilers for the first two books in the series.</b></p> <p>Held hostage by a murderer, his noose tightens around my neck.</p> <p>There’s only one chance for escape.</p> <p>One chance for happiness.</p> <p>His brother.</p> <p>Meanwhile, Hayden and Hawk fight a desperate battle against the mob my husband sent to hunt us down. My baby girl is in danger, and I can’t help her. Everything rests on them getting to her first.</p> <p>Even if we make it through all of this, Josiah and his cult of followers won’t stop.</p> <p>We fight them together.</p> <p>Or we all fall.</p> <p><b><i>Three to Fall </i></b>is an adult, why choose romance, meaning the main character has more than one love interest. This book contains romantic suspense and dark themes that may trigger some listeners. It is the final book in a now complete trilogy. Start the series with Wife Number One, and Torn in Two.</p>"; 
